== 04:31:12 sign the failover policy pinning the primary's chip and the TDX standby
== 04:31:12 pull the primary's outbox replica, continuously
== 04:31:12 arm: sagvd failover (on TDX, its escrow key unsealed from the vTPM) watches the replica; the standby is the Trust Domain across the VPC
